DECISION	DW5230RQY	ARCH	-	CardManifest keeps four generics; trial detail shapes are narrowed inside each card, never a fifth generic	adr=docs/decisions/0002-four-generics.md	anchor=src/core/cardContract.ts@80614709	revisit_when=event:cross_card_detail_aggregation	why=the kernel never consumes details, so a fifth generic buys nothing and forces empty declarations on cards without analytics
