DECISION	DMFM2ZJ4S	ARCH	-	difficulty is a perceptual quantity (DeltaE_OK, inverse-distance scaling); never fixed pixels or raw HSV deltas	anchor=src/core/color/oklchUtils.ts#getTargetDeltaEForLevel@85e9322f	revisit_when=event:fixed_pixel_difficulty	why=HSV is perceptually non-uniform, so raw tolerances made far and near items unequal at the same level
DECISION	D47WDRSJM	ARCH	-	accuracy is only a convergence indicator; Level is the progress metric shown to users	anchor=src/core/engine/adaptiveEngine.ts#recordBlock@aa2c7231	revisit_when=event:accuracy_as_primary_metric	why=adaptive targeting pins accuracy near 0.8, so accuracy cannot express growth and misleads users
